# Wave T34 (Highbranch kit): leafroof — Highbranch's own roof kind.
# LEAFSCALE ROOF: overlapping leaf scales in canopy greens — deep
# scale shadow, leaf bodies, lit tips, sparse vein flecks; scale
# rows scallop every 4px. A grown roof, not a tiled one:
# structurally unlike Meadowbrook's sage stone courses, Cinder's
# mossy shingles, Eldergrove's banded thatch, Wildflower's open
# trellis and the shipped tr-fortree dark shingle. Worn by the
# Gym, the House and the town's two facade cottages.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T34-HIGHBRANCH-PLAN.md.)
